    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) la mise en &#x153;uvre compl&#xe8;te de l&#x2019;Accord de paix et de r&#xe9;conciliation nationale sign&#xe9; &#xe0; Maputo; 2) l&#x2019;ach&#xe8;vement du d&#xe9;sarmement et de la d&#xe9;mobilisation des ex-combattants de la RENAMO, conform&#xe9;ment au protocole d&#x2019;entente et le concept de reintegration qui ont &#xe9;t&#xe9; convenus en collaboration.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes for this project include: (1) full implementation of the Maputo Accord for Peace and National Reconciliation; and (2) disarmament and demobilization of RENAMO ex-combatants completed as per the Memorandum of Understanding and the Reintegration Concept, which were collaboratively agreed upon.</narrative>
    </description>
